<title>UK: LIFFE March white sugar delivery totals 423 lots.</title>
<headline>LIFFE March white sugar delivery totals 423 lots.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of 423 lots of white sugar, equivalent to 21,150 tonnes, was delivered against the London March No.5 contract after it expired on Thursday, the London International Financial Futures Exchange (LIFFE) said.</p>
<p>Details are as follows:</p>
<p> SELLER	   LOTS     BUYER		   PORT</p>
<p> Refco	     240     E D &amp; F Man	Rostock</p>
<p> Bache		55     E D &amp; F Man    Eemshaven</p>
<p> Bache	     128     E D &amp; F Man    Immingham</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
